    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cattopia is an energetic momentum-based 2D platformer where you use a fishing line to swing around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/d4798a9e8ac73d79970fc82eeef2b0e3.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/d4798a9e8ac73d79970fc82eeef2b0e3.apng?t=1754176714\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Catto, a stuffed animal chasing a dream of <i>fishin'!</i> Help him swing through many branching paths while catching fish and helping out his friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/75663273ae5c03ea2c655dc987a5cf7a.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/75663273ae5c03ea2c655dc987a5cf7a.gif?t=1754176714\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple unique endings based on the path you take</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch different fish hidden throughout your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift items to other animals to become friends with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Catnip to gain extra lives for Catto</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your clear times for each exit to earn exclusive ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play bonus modes and minigames to put your skills to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own set of Dreams to share with the powerful in-game level editor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/ba13a7bf37c112e661b60137bac699e0.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/ba13a7bf37c112e661b60137bac699e0.webm?t=1754176714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cattopia is an energetic momentum-based 2D platformer where you use a fishing line to swing around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/d4798a9e8ac73d79970fc82eeef2b0e3.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/d4798a9e8ac73d79970fc82eeef2b0e3.apng?t=1754176714\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Catto, a stuffed animal chasing a dream of <i>fishin'!</i> Help him swing through many branching paths while catching fish and helping out his friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/75663273ae5c03ea2c655dc987a5cf7a.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/75663273ae5c03ea2c655dc987a5cf7a.gif?t=1754176714\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple unique endings based on the path you take</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch different fish hidden throughout your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gift items to other animals to become friends with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Catnip to gain extra lives for Catto</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your clear times for each exit to earn exclusive ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play bonus modes and minigames to put your skills to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own set of Dreams to share with the powerful in-game level editor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/ba13a7bf37c112e661b60137bac699e0.poster.avif?t=1754176714\" width=800 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305690/extras/ba13a7bf37c112e661b60137bac699e0.webm?t=1754176714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
